{"thread":{"threadID":4132,"boardID":117,"topic":"Store Update 01.02.2017 - TTT and Knife Server Skins","time":1485904190,"userID":1825,"username":"Nachtfrische","lastPostTime":1486086375,"lastPoster":"??NN!!","replies":21,"views":1215,"attachments":0,"isSticky":0,"isClosed":0,"cumulativeLikes":6},"tags":[{"tagID":210,"name":"changelog"},{"tagID":281,"name":"Community"},{"tagID":207,"name":"csgo"},{"tagID":984,"name":"deutsch"},{"tagID":142,"name":"gewinnspiel"},{"tagID":28,"name":"jail"},{"tagID":295,"name":"knife"},{"tagID":1054,"name":"models"},{"tagID":1053,"name":"player"},{"tagID":507,"name":"Skins"},{"tagID":107,"name":"store"},{"tagID":208,"name":"ttt"},{"tagID":209,"name":"update"}],"posts":[{"postID":60767,"threadID":4132,"userID":1825,"username":"Nachtfrische","subject":"Store Update 01.02.2017 - TTT and Knife Server Skins","time":1485904190,"lastEditTime":1486060227,"editCount":7,"editReason":"","attachments":[],"cumulativeLikes":6,"editorID":1825,"editor":"Nachtfrische","likes":[{"userID":2229,"username":"WHAT","time":1485910529,"value":1},{"userID":2369,"username":"Luckiris","time":1485929493,"value":1},{"userID":2318,"username":"PEYZO","time":1485945139,"value":1},{"userID":2043,"username":"ApudoX","time":1485948691,"value":1},{"userID":2039,"username":"Wario","time":1485952860,"value":1},{"userID":2404,"username":"Mas0n","time":1485955015,"value":1}],"bodyHtml":"<div class=\"message-align\"><p><span class=\"missing-media\">[Bild]</span></p></div><p><br><strong>--- Knife Server ---</strong><br>- We&#x27;ve decided to add <strong>6</strong> new Player Skins to further enhance the fun on the server. <br>Five of those skins will be available for free and one of the skins is <strong>exclusive for Donators</strong>.</p>\n<p><br></p>\n<p>- Every skin will be priced at 10000 credits, since skins are supposed to be pretty uncommon and highly sought-after.<br>Here is a list of the skins: (big thanks to <a href=\"http://dream-community.de/index.php?user/2369-luckiris/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\">@Luckiris</a> for testing and also helping me with the screenshots!)</p>\n<p><br></p>\n<p><strong>Duke Nukem (10000) (CT Only)</strong><br></p>\n<details><summary>Spoiler</summary><p><span class=\"missing-media\">[Bild]</span><span class=\"missing-media\">[Bild]</span></p></details><p><br></p>\n<p><strong>Evil Snowman (10000) (T Only)</strong><br></p>\n<details><summary>Spoiler</summary><p><span class=\"missing-media\">[Bild]</span></p></details><p><br></p>\n<p><strong>Nepgear (10000) (T Only)</strong><br></p>\n<details><summary>Spoiler</summary><p><span class=\"missing-media\">[Bild]</span></p></details><p><br></p>\n<p><strong>Solid Snake (10000) (CT Only)</strong><br></p>\n<details><summary>Spoiler</summary><p><span class=\"missing-media\">[Bild]</span></p></details><p><br></p>\n<p><strong>Banana Joe (10000) (CT Only)</strong><strong> - DONATOR EXCLUSIVE</strong><br></p>\n<details><summary>Spoiler</summary><p><span class=\"missing-media\">[Bild]</span><span class=\"missing-media\">[Bild]</span></p></details><p><br></p>\n<p><strong>Donald Trump (10000) (T Only)</strong><strong> - DONATOR EXCLUSIVE</strong><br></p>\n<details><summary>Spoiler</summary><p><span class=\"missing-media\">[Bild]</span></p></details><p><br></p>\n<p><strong>--- TTT Server ---</strong><br>- Wie <a href=\"http://dream-community.de/index.php?thread/4124-ttt-mapvorschlag/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\">in diesem Thread</a> erwähnt, wurden die folgenden Maps zum Server hinzugefügt (Danke an <a href=\"http://dream-community.de/index.php?user/1812-mike/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\">@Mike</a> für den umfassenden Vorschlag)<br></p>\n<ul>\n<li>ttt_biocube_sgport</li>\n<li>ttt_clue</li>\n<li>ttt_community_bowling_csgo_v3</li>\n<li>ttt_hotwireslum</li>\n<li>ttt_richburg</li>\n<li>ttt_spaceship</li>\n</ul>\n<p>- Ebenso wurde auf Vorschlag von <a href=\"http://dream-community.de/index.php?user/1812-mike/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\">@Mike</a> dank <a href=\"http://dream-community.de/index.php?user/1253-blackfire/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\">@BlackFire</a> auch eine Hurt Station für den Preis von 3000 hinzugefügt</p>\n<p><br></p>\n<p>- <s>Das Plugin für die Waffenskins wurde für weitere Untersuchung entfernt, da dieses einen Servercrash verursachte</s><br>EDIT: - Dieser Crash wurde eben gelöst, somit sind Waffenskins nun wieder aktiviert.</p>\n<p><br></p>\n<p>- Auch beim TTT wurden auf Vorschlag von <a href=\"http://dream-community.de/index.php?user/1812-mike/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\">@Mike</a> <strong>zwei </strong>Player Skins / Models eingefügt. Diese sehen wie folgt aus: (danke an <a href=\"http://dream-community.de/index.php?user/2369-luckiris/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\">@Luckiris</a>)</p>\n<p><br></p>\n<p><strong>Ezio Auditore da Firenze (10000)</strong><br></p>\n<details><summary>Spoiler</summary><p><span class=\"missing-media\">[Bild]</span><span class=\"missing-media\">[Bild]</span></p></details><p><br></p>\n<p><strong>Agent 47 (10000)</strong><br></p>\n<details><summary>Spoiler</summary><p><span class=\"missing-media\">[Bild]</span><span class=\"missing-media\">[Bild]</span></p></details><p><br></p>\n<p><strong>Donald Trump (10000)</strong><strong> - DONATOR EXCLUSIVE</strong><br></p>\n<details><summary>Spoiler</summary><p><span class=\"missing-media\">[Bild]</span></p></details>","polls":[]},{"postID":60768,"threadID":4132,"userID":262,"username":"Deagletrix","subject":"","time":1485904491,"lastEditTime":0,"editCount":0,"editReason":null,"attachments":[],"cumulativeLikes":0,"editorID":null,"editor":"","likes":[],"bodyHtml":"<p>NICE</p>","polls":[]},{"postID":60769,"threadID":4132,"userID":1153,"username":"Schockly","subject":"","time":1485905697,"lastEditTime":0,"editCount":0,"editReason":null,"attachments":[],"cumulative